LUMAX unused internal variable cleanup
Removed only unobserved internal state and dead calculations in Top, used Top helpers and scaling.
All files, utility functions, constructor parameters and module ports retained. SplitEnable, unused imports, spare module instances and incomplete out_sint branch retained. No SW kernel or Python model edits.
Actual make verilog / CIRCT generation before and after; no new numerical Verilator tests.
Functional comparison strips comments/formatting, consistently renames three compiler temporaries, excludes simulator RANDOMIZE_REG_INIT bookkeeping, and canonicalizes one explicit unsigned a*b+c versus c+b*a expression. Reset and sequential/combinational hardware logic are retained. This is an HDL comparison, not a numerical simulation or a general formal-equivalence tool.
